## . [just] Just tools=just
default                  Other          declared exact  safe        .          just default :: Default: list recipes
test                     Testing        declared exact  safe        .          just test :: Run the full test suite
check                    Quality        declared exact  safe        .          just check :: Check formatting and lints
build                    Build          declared exact  safe        .          just build :: Build the Rust project in release mode
publish                  Release        declared exact  external    .          just publish :: Publish to crates.io
_setup                   Other          declared exact  safe        hidden .          just _setup :: Manage the Rust toolchain
db-reset                 Database       declared exact  destructive .          just db-reset :: Reset the local database
watch                    Development    declared exact  safe        .          just watch :: Rebuild on change with cargo-watch
